# Summary

The agreement's allocation rule for plots is: "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement." [[cite:obs-f9210208adb0175940447ec4ef189bc4c24ce9d5 "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]

The agreement does not specify the size of a plot; the "Plots" section contains only the sentence "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement." [[cite:obs-f9210208adb0175940447ec4ef189bc4c24ce9d5 "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]
